    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Clare Connolly Estate Agent is delighted to present Apartment 69 Southmede, Ballinteer Road, Dublin 16, to the market for sale. This superb two-bedroom, two-bathroom second-floor apartment is well-proportioned, bright and spacious throughout and enjoys a pleasant outlook over the landscaped communal grounds and water feature. Situated within the highly sought-after Southmede development, the property offers secure gated living, beautifully maintained communal grounds and an excellent location in one of South Dublin’s most desirable areas.\r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 72.8 sqm (783 sq.ft.), the accommodation is well laid out and provides comfortable and practical living space. The property comprises a spacious entrance hallway with hot press and storage, leading into a bright and generous open-plan living and dining area with recessed lighting and direct access to a private balcony. The fully equipped kitchen is conveniently positioned just off the main living space.\r\n\r\nThere are two generously proportioned double bedrooms, both with built-in wardrobes, with the main bedroom benefiting from an en-suite. A main bathroom completes the accommodation. The apartment also benefits from one designated parking space. Gas fired central heating and double-glazed windows. BER C.\r\n\r\nA particular feature of Apartment 69 is its pleasant outlook over the communal gardens and water feature, providing a peaceful and attractive setting. Southmede is a mature and well-maintained development offering residents privacy, security and landscaped surroundings, together with excellent access to a wide range of amenities.\r\n\r\nThe property is ideally positioned within a short stroll of Dundrum Town Centre, which offers an extensive selection of shops, restaurants, cafés, cinemas and entertainment facilities. The apartment is also conveniently located close to both Dundrum and Balally LUAS stations, providing swift and regular access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas.\r\n\r\nThe location also offers easy access to a wide range of recreational amenities, schools and sporting facilities throughout Dundrum, Ballinteer and the surrounding areas. The M50 motorway is readily accessible, providing excellent connectivity to Dublin Airport and the wider national road network.\r\n\r\nApartment 69 Southmede represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious and well-presented two-bedroom apartment in a secure and highly regarded development. With its generous accommodation, private balcony, designated parking space, attractive communal surroundings and superb location close to Dundrum Town Centre and the LUAS, this property is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, investors and owner-occupiers alike."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway: 3.31m x 3.81m\r\nOpen-Plan Living / Dining Room: 3.64m x 6.17m\r\nKitchen: 2.96m x 2.49m\r\nBedroom: 2.68m x 3.76m\r\nMaster Bedroom: 2.54m x 5.08m\r\nEn suite: 2.68 sqm\r\nMain Bathroom: 2.16m x 2.02m\r\nPrivate Balcony: 2.70m x 1.57m\r\n\r\nThe property measures approximately 72.8 sqm (783 sq.ft.) plus balcony 4.2 sqm."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tWell-presented second-floor apartment extending to approximately 72.8 sqm (783 sq.ft.). \r\n•\tGenerous living and dining space with recessed lighting and direct access to the private balcony. \r\n•\tEnjoys views over the landscaped communal grounds and water feature. \r\n•\tBoth bedrooms benefit from built-in wardrobes, providing excellent storage. \r\n•\tMain bedroom includes a private en-suite bathroom. \r\n•\tLocated within the highly regarded Southmede development, offering privacy and security. \r\n•\tIncludes one designated parking space within the development. \r\n•\tMature, beautifully maintained surroundings with attractive communal gardens and water feature. \r\n•\tWithin a short stroll of Dundrum Town Centre, with its extensive shopping, dining and entertainment options. \r\n•\tConveniently located close to Dundrum and Balally LUAS stations, with easy access to the M50 motorway and wider Dublin."
      },
